From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Lopez <norelec@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 08:58:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] force_driver 2 keeps the default driver, with a warning

It asked FNA3D for Vulkan, which FNA3D no longer has. The default is SDL_GPU:
Metal on macOS, D3D12 on Windows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFcBNQtF3Z7vfzi99BXwUe
---
 src/ClassicUO.Client/Main.cs | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ClassicUO.Client/Main.cs b/src/ClassicUO.Client/Main.cs
index 89536a91b..a58fed896 100644
--- a/src/ClassicUO.Client/Main.cs
+++ b/src/ClassicUO.Client/Main.cs
@@ -210,8 +210,12 @@ namespace ClassicUO
 
                         break;
 
-                    case 2: // Vulkan
-                        Environment.SetEnvironmentVariable("FNA3D_FORCE_DRIVER", "Vulkan");
+                    case 2: // Vulkan, dropped from FNA3D
+                        Log.Warn(
+                            "force_driver 2 asked for Vulkan, which FNA3D no longer has: "
+                            + "using the default driver (SDL_GPU, which is Metal on macOS "
+                            + "and D3D12 on Windows)."
+                        );
 
                         break;
                 }
